---
---

<section class="architecture-section section-padding">
  <div class="container">
    
    <div class="section-header">
      <span class="section-badge badge-orange">Ingeniería de Sistemas Embebidos</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">Arquitectura de Firmware C++17 & Pipeline Gráfico</h2>
      <p class="section-description">
        El firmware de Lúa está construido con una separación estricta de responsabilidades: el núcleo de renderizado y lógica no depende de Arduino ni del sistema operativo, permitiendo compilar exactamente el mismo código para el microcontrolador y para el simulador de escritorio.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Main Architecture Grid -->
    <div class="arch-cards-grid">
      
      <!-- Card 1: Core & Specs -->
      <div class="arch-card glass-card">
        <div class="card-header">
          <div class="card-icon icon-orange">
            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><rect x="4" y="4" width="16" height="16" rx="2"/><rect x="9" y="9" width="6" height="6"/><line x1="9" y1="1" x2="9" y2="4"/><line x1="15" y1="1" x2="15" y2="4"/><line x1="9" y1="20" x2="9" y2="23"/><line x1="15" y1="20" x2="15" y2="23"/><line x1="20" y1="9" x2="23" y2="9"/><line x1="20" y1="14" x2="23" y2="14"/><line x1="1" y1="9" x2="4" y2="9"/><line x1="1" y1="14" x2="4" y2="14"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Especificaciones de Hardware</h3>
        </div>
        <div class="tech-specs-list">
          <div class="spec-row">
            <span class="spec-name">Microcontrolador (MCU)</span>
            <span class="spec-val highlight-orange">ESP32-C3 (RISC-V 160MHz)</span>
          </div>
          <div class="spec-row">
            <span class="spec-name">Pantalla & Controlador</span>
            <span class="spec-val">IPS Circular 240×240 (GC9A01 · SPI)</span>
          </div>
          <div class="spec-row">
            <span class="spec-name">Pila de Comunicación</span>
            <span class="spec-val">NimBLE (Bluetooth LE 5.0)</span>
          </div>
          <div class="spec-row">
            <span class="spec-name">Buffer de Renderizado</span>
            <span class="spec-val">Franjas de 24 filas (11,5 KB DMA)</span>
          </div>
          <div class="spec-row">
            <span class="spec-name">Zero-Dependencies Sim</span>
            <span class="spec-val">Sockets POSIX + HTML5 Canvas</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 2: Rendering Pipeline -->
      <div class="arch-card glass-card">
        <div class="card-header">
          <div class="card-icon icon-cyan">
            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polygon points="12 2 2 7 12 12 22 7 12 2"/><polyline points="2 17 12 22 22 17"/><polyline points="2 12 12 17 22 12"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Reparto del Repositorio</h3>
        </div>
        <div class="repo-layers">
          <div class="layer-item">
            <code class="layer-code">core/</code>
            <div class="layer-desc">
              <strong>El firmware real:</strong> rejilla, máquina de estados, parches de expresiones (5×5 ojos / 5×10 hocico) y motor de partículas. Sin OS.
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="layer-item">
            <code class="layer-code">sim/</code>
            <div class="layer-desc">
              <strong>Emulador de escritorio:</strong> servidor HTTP mínimo con mandos y telemetría (<code class="inline-code">make run</code> en <code class="inline-code">localhost:8080</code>).
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="layer-item">
            <code class="layer-code">esp32/</code>
            <div class="layer-desc">
              <strong>Solo transporte:</strong> recepción BLE vía NimBLE y volcado DMA por SPI al GC9A01. No dibuja nada.
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="layer-item">
            <code class="layer-code">protocol/</code>
            <div class="layer-desc">
              <strong>Fuente de verdad de opcodes:</strong> sincronizada con Valeria+ mediante gates automatizados.
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Verification Gates Strip (45,722 Tests) -->
    <div class="gates-container glass-card">
      <div class="gates-header">
        <div>
          <span class="gates-badge">CI / CD Gates</span>
          <h3 class="gates-title">5 Gates de Verificación Automática (45.722 Tests · 0 Fallos)</h3>
        </div>
        <span class="status-pill status-green">
          <svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
          100% Passing
        </span>
      </div>

      <div class="gates-table-wrap">
        <table class="gates-table">
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th>Gate / Script</th>
              <th>Propósito Clínico y Técnico</th>
              <th>Estado</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr>
              <td><code>tests/test_device.cpp</code></td>
              <td>Verifica que la concesión caduque (100 de 100), el bloqueo sobreviva a caídas y las franjas sean idénticas al frame completo.</td>
              <td><span class="gate-status green">PASS</span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><code>tools/check-lua-mute.js</code></td>
              <td>Bloquea el build si detecta cualquier intento de incluir micrófono o salida de audio no autorizada.</td>
              <td><span class="gate-status green">PASS</span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><code>tools/check-sprite-parity.js</code></td>
              <td>Garantiza que la gata de píxel art del firmware sea idéntica carácter a carácter a <code>ValeriaCatPixel.tsx</code>.</td>
              <td><span class="gate-status green">PASS</span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><code>tools/build-art.js --check</code></td>
              <td>Comprueba la paridad matemática de los 66 pictogramas y 45 insignias (24×24) contra <code>ValeriaPixelArt.ts</code>.</td>
              <td><span class="gate-status green">PASS</span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><code>tools/build-protocol.js --check</code></td>
              <td>Garantiza la sincronización binaria de opcodes y cabeceras C++ con la tabla compartida de Valeria+.</td>
              <td><span class="gate-status green">PASS</span></td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- startTIC & Gradiant IoT Hardware Validation Strip -->
    <div class="starttic-lua-card glass-card">
      <div class="starttic-lua-header">
        <div class="starttic-icon-pill">🚀</div>
        <div>
          <span class="starttic-eyebrow">Incubadora de Alta Tecnología startTIC</span>
          <h3 class="starttic-lua-title">Validación Tecnológica de Hardware & IoT con GRADIANT</h3>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="starttic-lua-desc">
        El desarrollo de la arquitectura embebida de Lúa (ESP32-C3 RISC-V, Bluetooth LE 5.0 y renderizado por DMA sobre bus SPI) se beneficia de la mentoría especializada de <strong>GRADIANT</strong> y los laboratorios avanzados del <strong>Consorcio de la Zona Franca de Vigo</strong> en el VgoTIC Global HUB, bajo el programa cofinanciado al 60% por <strong>FEDER</strong> a través de la Fundación INCYDE.
      </p>
      <div class="starttic-metrics-row">
        <div class="starttic-metric">
          <span class="m-val">BLE 5.0</span>
          <span class="m-lbl">NimBLE Zero-PHI Validado</span>
        </div>
        <div class="starttic-metric">
          <span class="m-val">0 dB</span>
          <span class="m-lbl">Inmunidad Acústica Clínica</span>
        </div>
        <div class="starttic-metric">
          <span class="m-val">VgoTIC</span>
          <span class="m-lbl">HUB Tecnológico de Vigo</span>
        </div>
        <div class="starttic-metric">
          <span class="m-val">FEDER 60%</span>
          <span class="m-lbl">Programa Plurirregional</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .architecture-section {
    padding: 80px 0 100px 0;
    position: relative;
  }

  .section-header {
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 860px;
    margin: 0 auto 3.5rem auto;
  }

  .section-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0.35rem 1.1rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
  }

  .badge-orange {
    background: rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.12);
    border: 1px solid rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.35);
    color: #fb923c;
  }

  .section-title {
    font-size: 2.6rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .section-description {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .arch-cards-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .arch-card {
    padding: 2.25rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
  }

  .card-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
    padding-bottom: 1rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
  }

  .card-icon {
    width: 44px;
    height: 44px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .icon-orange {
    background: rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.15);
    border: 1px solid rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.4);
    color: #fb923c;
  }

  .icon-cyan {
    background: rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.15);
    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.4);
    color: var(--accent-cyan);
  }

  .card-header h3 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--text-main);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .tech-specs-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.1rem;
  }

  .spec-row {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    padding-bottom: 0.75rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
  }

  .spec-row:last-child {
    border-bottom: none;
    padding-bottom: 0;
  }

  .spec-name {
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .spec-val {
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-main);
    font-family: monospace;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  .highlight-orange {
    color: #fb923c;
  }

  .repo-layers {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }

  .layer-item {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  .layer-code {
    font-family: monospace;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--accent-cyan);
    background: rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.1);
    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.25);
    padding: 0.25rem 0.6rem;
    border-radius: 6px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .layer-desc {
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .layer-desc strong {
    color: var(--text-main);
  }

  .inline-code {
    font-family: monospace;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    color: #fcd34d;
    background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.1);
    padding: 0.15rem 0.35rem;
    border-radius: 4px;
  }

  /* Gates Container */
  .gates-container {
    padding: 2.25rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
  }

  .gates-header {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
    padding-bottom: 1.25rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
  }

  .gates-badge {
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--accent-cyan);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }

  .gates-title {
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--text-main);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .status-pill {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    padding: 0.35rem 0.85rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  .status-green {
    background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.15);
    border: 1px solid rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.4);
    color: #34d399;
  }

  .gates-table-wrap {
    overflow-x: auto;
  }

  .gates-table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    text-align: left;
  }

  .gates-table th {
    padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
  }

  .gates-table td {
    padding: 1rem;
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
    vertical-align: middle;
  }

  .gates-table code {
    font-family: monospace;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: #38bdf8;
    background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.1);
    padding: 0.2rem 0.45rem;
    border-radius: 4px;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .gate-status {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0.25rem 0.6rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .gate-status.green {
    background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.2);
    color: #34d399;
    border: 1px solid rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.4);
  }

  /* startTIC Lua Card */
  .starttic-lua-card {
    margin-top: 2rem;
    padding: 2.25rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.06) 0%, rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75) 100%);
    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.3);
    box-shadow: 0 0 35px -10px rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.18);
  }

  .starttic-lua-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .starttic-icon-pill {
    font-size: 2rem;
    background: rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.12);
    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.35);
    width: 52px;
    height: 52px;
    border-radius: 14px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .starttic-eyebrow {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--accent-cyan);
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }

  .starttic-lua-title {
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--text-main);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .starttic-lua-desc {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.65;
    margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
  }

  .starttic-lua-desc strong {
    color: var(--text-main);
  }

  .starttic-metrics-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(180px, 1fr));
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .starttic-metric {
    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
    text-align: center;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.25rem;
  }

  .starttic-metric .m-val {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    font-weight: 900;
    color: var(--accent-cyan);
  }

  .starttic-metric .m-lbl {
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .architecture-section {
      padding: 60px 0;
    }
    .arch-cards-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .starttic-lua-header {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 0.75rem;
    }
    .starttic-metrics-row {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
